over--strategy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"blog-cover-topic\">Growth strategy</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M50 210H170V100H310V155H510\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"210\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"100\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"155\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"510\" cy=\"155\" r=\"16\"/></svg><span class=\"blog-cover-word\">Connect the dots.</span></div><div class=\"blog-card-copy\"><p class=\"blog-card-title\">10 questions to ask a growth agency</p><p class=\"blog-card-summary\">Ten questions that reveal how an agency connects search, paid media and content with the customers your business needs.</p><p class=\"blog-card-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 3 min read</p></div></a></div></section></aside>"
